                  <li>Led a distributed engineering team — architecture decisions, code quality, mentoring, and Agile delivery in a remote-first environment</li>
                  <li>Diagnosed and resolved a critical data processing bottleneck, reducing runtime from 45 minutes to 20 seconds <strong>(135× improvement)</strong></li>
                  <li>Temporarily assumed Scrum Master, SDET, and Technical Writer responsibilities during transition periods, maintaining delivery continuity</li>
                  <li>Collaborated with global stakeholders across multiple time zones (US, UK, Asia)</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="tl-tech">
                  <span>ASP.NET Core</span><span>React</span><span>SQL Server</span>
                  <span>Azure DevOps</span><span>NUnit</span><span>SSIS</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="tl-entry" data-animate data-animate-delay="60">
              <div class="tl-marker" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="tl-dot"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="tl-body">
                <div class="tl-meta">
                  <time class="tl-period">Jan 2016 – Jan 2019</time>
                  <span class="tl-duration">3 years</span>
                </div>
                <div class="tl-company">Deltek Systems (Philippines) Ltd.</div>
                <div class="tl-roles">
                  <span class="role-badge">Software Engineer — Automation Team</span>
                </div>
                <div class="tl-location">Manila, Philippines</div>
                <ul class="tl-bullets">
                  <li>Designed and built web and desktop test automation frameworks from scratch, reducing manual QA effort by ~50%</li>
                  <li>Delivered two internal R&amp;D tools (Single Sign-On platform, Test Results Manager) later adopted as standard solutions across multiple product teams</li>
                  <li>Worked cross-functionally with QA and engineering teams to improve test reliability and release confidence</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="tl-tech">
                  <span>C#</span><span>Selenium</span><span>Coded UI</span>
                  <span>.NET Framework</span><span>SQL Server</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </li>

            <li class="tl-entry tl-entry--last" data-animate data-animate-delay="120">
              <div class="tl-marker" aria-hidden="true">
                <div class="tl-dot"></div>
              </div>
              <div class="tl-body">
                <div class="tl-meta">
                  <time class="tl-period">Jul 2013 – Jan 2016</time>
                  <span class="tl-duration">2.5 years</span>
                </div>
                <div class="tl-company">EastWest Banking Corporation</div>
                <div class="tl-roles">
                  <span class="role-badge">Programmer-Analyst (2013)</span>
                  <span class="role-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                  <span class="role-badge">Assistant Manager (2014)</span>
                </div>
                <div class="tl-location">Manila, Philippines · Systems Development</div>
                <ul class="tl-bullets">
