                  <li>Developed an in-house cheque warehousing system to manage high volumes of future-dated loan payment cheques</li>
                  <li>Built compliance-critical internal banking applications and reports for multiple business units</li>
                </ul>
                <div class="tl-tech">
                  <span>C#</span><span>.NET Framework</span><span>SQL Server</span>
                  <span>T24 Banking System</span>
                </div>
              </div>
            </li>

          </ol>
        </div>
      </section>

